syntax synthesizedValue = 
   | DEFAULT (from defaultValue) 
   | {#} (from invalidHeaderValue) 
   | SEQ ( value* ) (from sequenceValue) 
   | SEQ ( value* , ... ) (from sequenceValue) 
   | RECORD { fieldValue* } (from recordValue) 
   | RECORD { fieldValue* , ... } (from recordValue) 
   | SET { value } (from setValue) 
   | SET { value* ( nat ) } (from setValue) 
   | SET { value &&& value } (from setValue) 
   | SET { value .. value } (from setValue) 
   | SET { ... } (from setValue) 
   | TABLE_ENUM typeId . nameIR (from tableMetadataEnumValue) 
   | TABLE_STRUCT typeId { HIT boolValue ; MISS boolValue ; ACTION_RUN tableMetadataEnumValue ; } (from tableMetadataStructValue) 

