  10. Case (% has type headerUnionTypeIR)

    1. (Let headerUnionTypeIR be (typeIR as headerUnionTypeIR))

      1. (Let (HEADER_UNION typeId < (typeArgumentIR)* > { ((annotationList typeIR_field nameIR_field ;))* }) be headerUnionTypeIR)

        1. (Let typeArgumentIR_subst be $subst_typeIR'(theta, typeArgumentIR))*

          1. (Let typeIR_field_subst be $subst_typeIR'(theta, typeIR_field))*

            1. If (((|(annotationList)*| = |(nameIR_field)*|) /\ (|(nameIR_field)*| = |(typeIR_field_subst)*|))), then

              1. (Let headerUnionTypeIR_subst be (HEADER_UNION typeId < (typeArgumentIR_subst)* > { ((annotationList typeIR_field_subst nameIR_field ;))* }))

                1. Return (headerUnionTypeIR_subst as typeIR)

            1. Else Dangling#982

  11. Case (% has type simpleEnumTypeIR)

    1. (Let (ENUM typeId { (id_field)* }) be (typeIR as simpleEnumTypeIR))

      1. Return ((ENUM typeId { (id_field)* }) as typeIR)

  12. Case (% has type serializableEnumTypeIR)

    1. (Let (ENUM typeId < typeIR' > { (valueFieldIR)* }) be (typeIR as serializableEnumTypeIR))

