def $bin_op(binop, value_l, value_r)

1. Case analysis on binop

  1. Case (% matches pattern `+`)

    1. Return $bin_plus(value_l, value_r)

  2. Case (% matches pattern `|+|`)

    1. Return $bin_satplus(value_l, value_r)

  3. Case (% matches pattern `-`)

    1. Return $bin_minus(value_l, value_r)

  4. Case (% matches pattern `|-|`)

    1. Return $bin_satminus(value_l, value_r)

  5. Case (% matches pattern `*`)

    1. Return $bin_mul(value_l, value_r)

  6. Case (% matches pattern `/`)

    1. Return $bin_div(value_l, value_r)

  7. Case (% matches pattern `%`)

    1. Return $bin_mod(value_l, value_r)

  8. Case (% matches pattern `<<`)

    1. Return $bin_shl(value_l, value_r)

  9. Case (% matches pattern `>>`)

    1. Return $bin_shr(value_l, value_r)

  10. Case (% matches pattern `<=`)

    1. Return ((`B $bin_le(value_l, value_r)) as value)

  11. Case (% matches pattern `>=`)

    1. Return ((`B $bin_ge(value_l, value_r)) as value)

  12. Case (% matches pattern `<`)

    1. Return ((`B $bin_lt(value_l, value_r)) as value)

  13. Case (% matches pattern `>`)

    1. Return ((`B $bin_gt(value_l, value_r)) as value)

  14. Case (% matches pattern `==`)

    1. Return ((`B $bin_eq(value_l, value_r)) as value)

  15. Case (% matches pattern `!=`)

    1. Return ((`B $bin_ne(value_l, value_r)) as value)

  16. Case (% matches pattern `&`)

    1. Return $bin_band(value_l, value_r)

  17. Case (% matches pattern `^`)

    1. Return $bin_bxor(value_l, value_r)

  18. Case (% matches pattern `|`)

    1. Return $bin_bor(value_l, value_r)

  19. Case (% matches pattern `++`)

    1. Return $bin_concat(value_l, value_r)

1. Else Dangling#1472

