          1. Case analysis on $in_set<id>(id, $dom_map<id, value>(frame))

            1. Case true

              1. (Let frame' be $update_map<id, value>(frame, id, value))

                1. Return EC[BLOCK.FRAME = frame']

            2. Case false

              1. Return $update_var_e((GLOBAL), EC, (` id), value)

    1. Else Dangling#9619

  3. Case (% matches pattern `LOCAL`)

